e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_6","text":"A long time ago, I heard there was a Nikke that did fight Raptures with her bare hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_7","text":"I scarcely believed it myself, but I couldn't get the thought out of my mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_8","text":"I'm not sure if it was because I wanted to see someone else pull it off, or if I wanted to accomplish it myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_9","text":"Even now, I still can't say what my motivation was...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_10","text":"At any rate, our squad was formed to see if melee combat was a viable combat option.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_claymore_02_e_11","text":"As you might have guessed, the experiment was a complete failure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_claymore_02_e_12","type":"Spee